<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"> <id>https://xystoy.com//</id><title>馨羽的玩具</title><subtitle>toy by iceeer collect.</subtitle> <updated>2026-11-15T20:55:58+08:00</updated> <author> <name>iceeer</name> <uri>https://xystoy.com//</uri> </author><link rel="self" type="application/atom+xml" href="https://xystoy.com//feed.xml"/><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="zh-CN" href="https://xystoy.com//"/> <generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.2.1">Jekyll</generator> <rights> © 2026 iceeer </rights> <icon>/assets/img/favicons/favicon.ico</icon> <logo>/assets/img/favicons/favicon-96x96.png</logo> <entry><title>家谱维护软件</title><link href="https://xystoy.com//posts/jiapu-weihu-software/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="家谱维护软件" /><published>2026-06-20T11:44:25+08:00</published> <updated>2026-06-20T11:44:25+08:00</updated> <id>https://xystoy.com//posts/jiapu-weihu-software/</id> <content src="https://xystoy.com//posts/jiapu-weihu-software/" /> <author> <name>iceeer</name> </author> <summary> 问题：想弄个家谱，不想用在线的。 解决：使用 My Family Tree。 </summary> </entry> <entry><title>Windows 2016安装.net 3.5</title><link href="https://xystoy.com//posts/windows-2016-install-dotnet35/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Windows 2016安装.net 3.5" /><published>2026-01-28T14:30:16+08:00</published> <updated>2026-01-28T14:30:16+08:00</updated> <id>https://xystoy.com//posts/windows-2016-install-dotnet35/</id> <content src="https://xystoy.com//posts/windows-2016-install-dotnet35/" /> <author> <name>iceeer</name> </author> <summary> 问题：Windows 2016安装SQL Server 2012时 提示缺.net 3.5。 处理：拷贝NetFx3.cab到windows目录下，执行命令 dism /online /Enable-Feature /all /FeatureName:NetFx3 /Source:"%windir%" /LimitAccess </summary> </entry> <entry><title>禁用计划任务提示没有禁用此任务的权限</title><link href="https://xystoy.com//posts/disable-planned-task/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="禁用计划任务提示没有禁用此任务的权限" /><published>2026-01-23T09:15:52+08:00</published> <updated>2026-01-23T09:15:52+08:00</updated> <id>https://xystoy.com//posts/disable-planned-task/</id> <content src="https://xystoy.com//posts/disable-planned-task/" /> <author> <name>iceeer</name> </author> <summary> 问题：禁用计划任务提示没有禁用此任务的权限 处理： cmd管理员运行，使用Sysinternals PsTools工具包中的psexec.exe以SYSTEM权限运行任务计划程序 psexec.exe -i -s %windir%\system32\mmc.exe /s taskschd.msc </summary> </entry> <entry><title>磁盘没空间</title><link href="https://xystoy.com//posts/disk-no-space/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="磁盘没空间" /><published>2026-01-09T11:06:08+08:00</published> <updated>2026-01-09T11:06:08+08:00</updated> <id>https://xystoy.com//posts/disk-no-space/</id> <content src="https://xystoy.com//posts/disk-no-space/" /> <author> <name>iceeer</name> </author> <summary> 问题：磁盘没空间 处理： 清理不用的文件 del /f/q/s %TEMP% del /f/q/s %TMP% 把文件夹移到其他盘，然后创建符号链接 echo 创建文件软链接示例: mklink "C:\Test1.txt" "D:\Test2.txt" echo 创建目录软链接示例: mklink /D "C:\Test1" "D:\Test2" 查链接到哪了：fsutil reparsepoint query C:\Test1 删除链接：rmdir /s /q C:\Test1 </summary> </entry> <entry><title>打开文件提示解锁</title><link href="https://xystoy.com//posts/open-file-unlock/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="打开文件提示解锁" /><published>2026-01-09T10:53:42+08:00</published> <updated>2026-01-09T10:53:42+08:00</updated> <id>https://xystoy.com//posts/open-file-unlock/</id> <content src="https://xystoy.com//posts/open-file-unlock/" /> <author> <name>iceeer</name> </author> <summary> 问题：打开文件提示解锁 处理：打开文件属性，取消锁定 或者运行cmd，批量解锁 </summary> </entry> </feed>
